:: day0_path_choice [nobr]
<h2>Which Form</h2>

<<locationImage "moonspire_ritual_chamber_prepared" "The Ritual Chamber, prepared for the Rite">>

<p>At the top of the stairs, Ilara stops me. Silver robes. The four sorceresses stand behind her, hooded. The Ritual Chamber door is open past her shoulder   I can see the altar, the candles, the painted stars. The air is thick with magic, humming against my skin.</p>

<p>She doesn't ask if I'm sure. My presence is the answer to that question. She asks the only one that's left.</p>

<div class="dialogue"><span class="speaker">ILARA</span>"Which form?"</div>

<p>No preamble. No explanation. No menu. She told me yesterday, in this same tower, twice. I've had the night. She respects me enough to expect an answer, not a discussion.</p>

<p class="path-intro">This is the last choice that is entirely your own. It will never be revisited   the two paths from here never merge again.</p>

<div class="path-choice-ritual">
  <div class="path-cards">
    <div class="path-card">
      <h3>🌙 Complete Transformation</h3>
      <p class="path-desc">"Complete." One word. The cleanest wound.</p>
      <ul class="path-notes">
        <li>Every aspect of the body changed</li>
        <li>Total biological conversion</li>
        <li>No trace of what came before</li>
      </ul>
      <<link "Choose Complete Transformation">>
        <<set $gamePath to "female">>
        <<set $d0_pathChosen to true>>
        <<goto "day0_ritual_female">>
      <</link>>
    </div>

    <div class="path-card">
      <h3>⚔ Partial Transformation</h3>
      <p class="path-desc">"Partial." One word. The preserved wound.</p>
      <ul class="path-notes">
        <li>A fully female body   and a preserved, strengthened cock</li>
        <li>Dual anatomy, both systems functional</li>
        <li>Unprecedented. Harder politically. Yours.</li>
      </ul>
      <<link "Choose Partial Transformation">>
        <<set $gamePath to "futa">>
        <<set $d0_pathChosen to true>>
        <<goto "day0_ritual_futa">>
      <</link>>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
